Package: qfagent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3
Description: QuartzFire cloud management agent (QuartzCommand client)
 Device identity (Ed25519, host-fingerprint clone protection), enrollment
 against the QuartzCommand cloud controller (token-triggered via
 `set system quartz-command enroll-token`), and the persistent outbound
 mTLS control channel with automatic certificate renewal.
 .
 Ships the `system quartz-command` config nodes, the `show quartz-command
 status` op-mode command, and the `qf` operator CLI (status, identity
 regenerate, prepare-template).
